{"reviewId": "380402079_80SbtYZ4w", "review": {"abstract": "我们这一代和“70后”的命运是最好的，“00后”也是最好的，1980年到2000年出生的人命运是最差的，因为既赶不上前面的技术创新周期，也赶不上商品周期，更赶不上下一个商品周期。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "16 一波三折 周期反弹节奏研究", "chapterUid": 21, "content": "人生财富靠康波……意思就是如果你出生在康波周期的繁荣阶段或技术的发展期，那么经济比较繁荣，你的收入和生活水平，财富就会比较多", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "6602-6691", "createTime": 1749798578, "title": "", "type": 1, "reviewId": "380402079_80SbtYZ4w", "userVid": 380402079, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 21, "chapterTitle": "16 一波三折 周期反弹节奏研究", "author": {"userVid": 380402079, "name": "@雁菁💞", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0013-YP88sMnDO5fc6f~Xb7tXUf6/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "@雁菁💞", "isV": 0, "vDesc": "文字中谋心，阅读中谋趣，烟火中谋生。", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "人丑就要多读书，腹有诗书气自华。", "medalInfo": {"id": "M2-0-500", "desc": "阅读时长", "title": "阅读时长", "levelIndex": 500}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 7, "likes": [{"userVid": 33543585, "name": "青山杳杳", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0019-YsMHDdjkQr2WPD1Ve_GZVf5/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20240527-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}], "commentsCount": 2, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "人出生的那一刻，命就注定了……因为时代是注定的，家庭背景是注定的，你所受的教育是注定的，你的智商是注定的，你的情商是注定的，你的性格是注定的，你的外表是注定的，你的基因是注定的，人是没有自主意识的，你所喜欢的，你的欲望都是注定的。", "reviewId": "380402079_80SbtYZ4w", "commentId": "380402079_80SbtYZ4w_c380402079_81Mp6mOAA", "userVid": 380402079, "createTime": 1752991868, "likesCount": 2, "isLike": 0, "author": {"userVid": 380402079, "name": "@雁菁💞", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0013-YP88sMnDO5fc6f~Xb7tXUf6/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "@雁菁💞", "isV": 0, "vDesc": "文字中谋心，阅读中谋趣，烟火中谋生。", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "人丑就要多读书，腹有诗书气自华。", "medalInfo": {"id": "M2-0-500", "desc": "阅读时长", "title": "阅读时长", "levelIndex": 500}}}, {"content": "不是出生在繁荣阶段吧？而是康波繁荣和技术发展阶段正好人在壮年，工资涨，财富积累加速，又有本金投资理财。出生在繁荣阶段等自己上班年纪刚好世界进入衰退了，也太惨了。", "reviewId": "380402079_80SbtYZ4w", "commentId": "380402079_80SbtYZ4w_c5838929_81BWrChm3", "userVid": 5838929, "createTime": 1752397612, "likesCount": 4, "isLike": 0, "author": {"userVid": 5838929, "name": "波鲁", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/XOibtkk6h2HwKvFsNgjFCwK0BVpsV2Qud0eHmnU3qH5VCiaFhlibcicF5FroUDHo3KbpkyCCPL5HGfF5ksNgAuic6sw/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "波鲁", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M1-0-30", "desc": "连续阅读", "title": "连续阅读", "levelIndex": 30}}}], "dislikeCount": 0, "synckey": 1786366036}